{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121904","id":4163068090,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc74I2C6","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121904","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121904.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121904.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121904","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121904/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121904/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121904/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/39ddc9c563b9f15b41e6c68a754da2ab8a9ecc37","number":121904,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix exported Packed*Array default values in the inspector","user":{"login":"sydist","id":81040138,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDQwMTM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81040138?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist","html_url":"https://github.com/sydist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sydist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Exported `Packed*Array` properties showed the wrong default in the editor.\r\nWith a default like `[\"something\"]`, adding an element gave `<null>`. With\r\n`PackedStringArray([\"something\"])`, the property showed as nil on a new node\r\nor after a reset.\r\n\r\nThe editor takes these defaults from the GDScript analyzer. Two things went\r\nwrong there:\r\n\r\n- An array literal reduces to an untyped `Array`, and nothing converted it to\r\n  the declared packed type. The inspector edited an `Array`, so resizing it\r\n  appended `null` instead of an empty string.\r\n- `make_call_reduced_value()` only handled the `Array()` and `Dictionary()`\r\n  constructors. Every other builtin constructor reduced to nothing, so the\r\n  default value ended up nil.\r\n\r\n`make_call_reduced_value()` now looks the type up with `get_builtin_type()`,\r\nso it handles all builtin constructors. `make_variable_default_value()` now\r\nconverts the reduced initializer to the variable's declared builtin type, the\r\nsame way `const` declarations already do.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.g